      "text": "the Lord commands Nephi1 to make plates for wise purpose, 1 Ne. 9:5 (W of M 1:7). all things have been done in wisdom of him who knows all things, 2 Ne. 2:24. O wisdom of God, 2 Ne. 9:8. sealed book to be revealed when the Lord sees fit in his wisdom, 2 Ne. 27:22. the Lord counsels in wisdom, Jacob 4:10 (Alma 29:8; 37:12). believe that God has all wisdom, Mosiah 4:9 (Alma 26:35). the all-wise Creator, Mosiah 29:19. record to be kept for wise purpose, Alma 37:2. when the Lord sees fit in wisdom, Three Nephites will minister to scattered tribes, 3 Ne. 28:29. writings to come forth when the Lord sees fit in his wisdom, 3 Ne. 29:1 (Morm. 5:13).",
